# Ignore JIT-provisioned workdirs (created by the source + workdir provisioners).
.workdir/

# Ignore local backend state written outside the workdir by the relative
# backend.local.path (../../../.context/tfstate/...).
.context/

# The "../escape-test-nowd" path-traversal probe (provision.workdir.enabled
# NOT set) now fails with ErrPathTraversal before writing anything --
# DetermineTargetDirectory in pkg/provisioner/source/source.go gained a
# containment guard, so this sibling directory should never actually be
# created. The ignore entry is kept defensively (harmless if empty, catches
# a regression that resurrects the escape rather than silently untracking a
# real vendored directory) rather than removed.
components/escape-test-nowd/

# Terraform files.
**/.terraform/
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.backup
**/.terraform.lock.hcl
**/backend.tf.json
**/*.terraform.tfvars.json
